{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7e3ecd5f-4025-8e19-9d79-c019c73e6156",
  "created_at": "2025-12-30T11:58:23-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Vincent Pellegrino",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:55:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:55:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good morning. Well, it's almost noon now, sure. Vincent Pellegrino. I'm calling about my water bill, it came in and it's about double what I normally pay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:55:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can you give me the service address so I can pull up the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:55:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, of course. It's 400 Carroll Avenue. Fifth Ward, up by the, well, you know, that's the address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:56:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Give me a moment. [pause] Okay, I have it. Your last bill is noticeably higher than the previous few. Does anything come to mind that would explain more usage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:56:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, no, I can't explain it. I'm one person, nobody extra staying. Nothing different. Well, the toilet was running constantly last month. Like all the time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:56:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That could do it. A running toilet can use a lot of water over a month, and you wouldn't necessarily see it. Has it been repaired?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:56:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, I fixed the flapper thing. It's fine now. But the bill is the bill, right? Of course, I get that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:56:46-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The bill reflects the meter reading, so the usage is what was recorded. I can note on the account that you had a leak that's now repaired. If you want, I can also have someone look at the meter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:57:01-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure, note it. That'd be great. Absolutely. Now, can I ask, can I pay it on the website with a card right now? I mean late in the day, or is that only when you're open?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:57:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The online payment page is available all hours. You can pay with a card any time, including evenings and weekends. It's only the counter here that has office hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:57:26-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, of course. So even at like ten at night. Good. Because I'm home today anyway. I'm a substitute teacher and no assignment came in this morning, so, you know, I've got the time to deal with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:57:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. You'll need your account number from the bill to log in or pay as a guest. It's printed near the top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:57:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I've got it right here. Yeah, it's the long one on the top. Absolutely. And the note about the toilet, that won't change the amount, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:57:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not by itself, no. I've added the note, and I'll flag the account for a meter check. Someone will contact you about scheduling that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:58:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. You have my number? It's 401-555-0150."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:58:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, 401-555-0150. I've got it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:58:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Of course. Well, thanks. Annoying, but thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:58:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Pellegrino. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
